# Subcategory (multi-brand) and live-on-site

Products may belong to one or many brands (Fossil, Tissot, Movado, Patek Philippe, etc.).

## Admin form (`AdminDashboard.jsx`)

- Keep `subCategory` as an **array in local state**.
- Submit a **clean string**: `"Fossil"` or comma-separated `"Fossil, Tissot"` for API backward compatibility. Do not submit only an array unless the API is updated everywhere.

## Category filtering (`CategoryPage.jsx`)

- Match brands with client-side substring: `pSub.includes(target)` so a multi-subcategory product appears under every selected brand.
- Normalize `subCategory` (string vs array) before matching; do not assume it is always a string.

## Live on site (`isActive`)

- `isActive: false` must never appear in customer category listings or search.
- `productsList` must filter `p.isActive !== false` so hidden items do not render.
